<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-SAULES SAYS NO INFORMATION ON TALLINNA.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-SAULES SAYS NO INFORMATION ON TALLINNA.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saules Bank said on Thursday it has no information about plans by Estonia's Tallinna Pank to take it over.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no information at our disposal with regard to Tallinna Pank planning to take over 100 percent of Saules Bank,&quot; Saules Bank's council chairman Yuri Shchetinin told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Estonia's Tallinna Pank said earlier today that it plans to take over 100 percent in the Saules bank, in which it already has a 20 percent stake.</p>
<p>Saules bank is the ninth biggest bank in Latvia in terms of assets.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
